  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "芬蘭音樂文化",
    "sub_ename": "FINNISH MUSIC CULTURE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程以芬蘭為例，旨在探討北歐人文傳統在全球文化中的獨特性。前三堂課將介紹芬蘭的歷史、文化、社會發展，以及在卓越領域（如教育、設計和建築）的表現；課程將從不同角度深入了解芬蘭的傳統和古典音樂，戰後著名的流行音樂和原住民音樂案例也將在課堂中介紹。從古老的口耳相傳的民謠傳統到現代音樂場景，本課程深入探討芬蘭音樂的活躍和多樣性。透過北歐社會人文的介紹，使學生更深入了解世界各地不同文化和觀點的差異，培養跨文化的敏感性。",
    "describe_eh": "This course takes Finland as an example, aiming to explore the uniqueness of Finnish music in global culture. The first three classes will introduce Finland's history, culture, social development, as well as its outstanding achievements in fields such as education, design, and architecture. The course will delve into Finland's traditional and classical music from different perspectives and, at the end of the term, briefly introduce notable post-war examples of popular and indigenous music. From the ancient oral tradition of folk music to the modern music scene, this course extensively examines the vibrancy and diversity of Finnish music. Through an introduction to Nordic humanities, it enables students to gain a deeper understanding of cultural and perspective differences worldwide, fostering cross-cultural sensitivity.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
