  "readings": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "XC04111",
    "sub_id": "GM823",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpc_seq": 1,
    "tpc_book": "<div>延伸閱讀</div>\n\n<div>音樂研究</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>Austerlitz, Paul. 2000. &ldquo;Birch-Bark Horns and Jazz in the National Imagination: The Finnish Folk Music Vogue in Historical Perspective.&rdquo; <em>Ethnomusicology</em> 44 (2): 183-213.</div>\n\n<div>Hill, Juniper.&nbsp;2007. &ldquo;&lsquo;Global Folk Music&rsquo; Fusions: The Reification of Transnational Relationships and the Ethics of Cross-Cultural Appropriations in Finnish Contemporary Folk Music.&rdquo; <em>Yearbook for Traditional Music</em> 39: 50-83.</div>\n\n<div>___2009a. &ldquo;Rebellious Pedagogy, Ideological Transformation, and Creative Freedom in Finnish Contemporary Folk Music.&rdquo; <em>Ethnomusicology</em> 53 (1): 86-114.</div>\n\n<div>___2009b. &ldquo;The Influence of Conservatory Folk Music Programmes: The Sibelius Academy in Comparative Context.&rdquo; <em>Ethnomusicology Forum </em>18 (2): 205-239.</div>\n\n<div>Kallioniemi, Kari, and Kimi K&auml;rki. 2009. &quot;The Kalevala, Popular Music and National Culture.&quot; <em>Journal of Finnish Studies</em> 13(2): 61-72.</div>\n\n<div>Lyle, Watson. 1927. &quot;The&quot; Nationalism&quot; of Sibelius.&quot; <em>The Musical Quarterly</em> 13(4): 617-629.</div>\n\n<div>Hsu, Hsin-Wen. 2014. Institutionalizing cultural forms: A Comparative Analysis of the Social Organization of Finnish Pelimanni and Taiwanese Hakka Music. Diss. Indiana University.</div>\n\n<div>Ramnarine, Tina Karina. 2003. Ilmatar&#39;s Inspirations: Nationalism, Globalization, and the Changing Soundscapes of Finnish Folk music. Chicago: University of Chicago Press.</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>社會文化</div>\n\n<div>Meinander, Henrik. 2020. History of Finland. Oxford University Press, USA, 2020.《芬蘭人的歷史》這本書提供了對芬蘭歷史的全面介紹，從古代到當代，包括在瑞典 和俄羅斯統治下的時期。</div>\n\n<div>Sahlberg, Pasi. 2021. Finnish lessons 3.0: What can the world learn from educational change in Finland?. Teachers College Press, 2021.《芬蘭的教育奇蹟》這本書深入研究了芬蘭教育體制，探討了芬蘭在教育方面的成功背後的原因。</div>\n\n<div>Korhonen, Karoliina. 2019. Finnish Nightmares: An Irreverent Guide to Life&#39;s Awkward Moments. Ten Speed Press, 2019. 這是一本插畫書，以輕鬆的方式呈現了 芬蘭文化和社會中的一些特點，特別是在社交場合中的尷尬時刻。</div>\n\n<div>Lewis, Richard D. 2011. Finland, cultural lone wolf. Nicholas Brealey. 這本書深入探討芬蘭文化的獨特性以及芬蘭在國際文化中的獨特地位。</div>\n\n<div>Millor, Andrew. <em>The Northern Silence Journeys in Nordic Music and Culture</em>. Yale University Press UK. 2022.</div>\n\n<div>孫用（譯），1981。《卡勒瓦拉》（上下冊），出版社：人民文學出版社。這是芬蘭國家史詩，由 L&ouml;nnrot 編纂自古老的口頭傳統和詩歌，呈現芬蘭的神話、英雄故事和文化。</div>\n\n<div>森山奈保美(Naomi Moriyama)，2024。《魔幻森林姊妹情 : 芬蘭卡累利阿的永續生活.智慧與覺醒》威廉.道爾(William Doyle)著，賴許刈譯，臺北市 : 橡樹林。</div>\n\n<div>郭秋慶, 2017。〈芬蘭的小國生存與發展之道〉。《台灣國際研究季刊》第13卷第3期：頁21-36。</div>\n",
    "tpc_book_en": null
  },
